      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "L5 radicular pain related to an epidural gas-containing pseudocyst is described in a 62-year-old female. Transient resolution of radicular pain was observed after CT-guided gas aspiration. Recurrent radicular pain led to surgical treatment; after operation the radicular pain disappeared."},
